


Its a simple program which will tell the strength of the password using LED


Condition we are going to go upon is 

length of 8 or more : +2
contains uppercase more than one
contains lowercase more than one 
contains numbers more than one 
contains special character more than 2 

we can create  a score base system where 0-2 = weak , 3-4 = medium , 5-7 = strong 




Lets talk about implementation 

we are going to go step by step 

1)start the program 
2) intialixze the 8051 micro controller 
3) initialize the password caharecter arry 
4) strength score = 0 [set to initialize]
5) get input from user and calculate the password 
6) check the password length with the condition stated above 
7)control LED accordinly
8) end of program

